{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411110","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411110","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1441111001:1":{"text":"おや、我らが石頭警備隊長と、その優秀な助手さんじゃないか。","source_cn":"这不是我的木头卫队长和他的得力助手嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D2BAA02A47233B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441111002:1":{"text":"そんなに急いでどうしたんだい？さあ、一杯飲んでリラックスしなよ。","source_cn":"别这么匆匆忙忙的，来斟杯美酒放松一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0137D06B6A6A711E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441111003:1":{"text":"サリエ殿下、この後の警備隊緊急会議にはあなたも……","source_cn":"沙利叶殿下，等会的卫队紧急会议需要您……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD0D1201AAED967B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441111004:1":{"text":"ああ、すっかり忘れてたよ。せっかく今夜の舞踏会では、キミにダンスをリードしてもらおうと思ったのに。","source_cn":"瞧我这脑子，本来还想让你来今晚的隐面舞宴领舞呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4325DD160E33F865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1441111005:1":{"text":"残念だけど、ボクの代わりに会議に出席してもらうしかないね。","source_cn":"那就辛苦我的卫队长代我出席会议了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD508DD07C15D50AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female"